// Title: Enable Microsoft Dynamic Data Exchange
// Rule ID: 63647769-326d-4dde-a419-b925cc0caf42
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1559.002
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
